    <Description>Translation of the Recon Pay (Recommended3) Fast Coastal into several non-English languages. Currently to Korean only.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]정찰 유닛 이동 강화 (권장 3) 빠른 연안의 모드의 비영어권 번역 모드입니다. 현재는 한국어만 가능합니다.</Description>
    <Authors>HANDANI</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>디시인사이드 문명 갤러리(DCinside Civilization Gallery)</SpecialThanks>
    <AffectsSavedGames>true</AffectsSavedGames>
    <MinCompatibleSaveVersion>0</MinCompatibleSaveVersion>
    <SupportsSinglePlayer>true</SupportsSinglePlayer>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>true</SupportsMultiplayer>
    <SupportsHotSeat>true</SupportsHotSeat>
    <SupportsMac>true</SupportsMac>
    <AssemblyName>Recon Pay (Recommended3) Fast Coastal INT</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Recon Pay (Recommended3) Fast Coastal INT</RootNamespace>
    <ModReferences />
    <Homepage>http://github.com/handanikr</Homepage>
    <ModDependencies>
      <Association xmlns="">
        <Type>Mod</Type>
        <Name>Recon Pay (Recommended3) Fast Coastal</Name>
        <Id>953c93bc-a53c-404a-bc35-659dbe00a170</Id>
        <MinVersion>0</MinVersion>
        <MaxVersion>999</MaxVersion>
      </Association>
    </ModDependencies>
    <ModActions>
      <Action xmlns="">
